  "outstanding": [
    "In the large-gap range, the existence, smoothness and uniqueness of the lowest type and the scalar action of the Casimir on smooth vectors are derived in the kernel realization (KRL-03 to KRL-05). The decomposition into compact highest weights is classical. The associated compact Casimir and word spaces are developed also in the global chapter.",
    "The estimates on complex words for the shifted moment and the short real words for the translated period have different direct providers and different separation thresholds. Integrability for the whole period requires the subgroup decay and power integral in addition to the derivative estimate."
  ]
